	<content contentuid="hb705697bg87e4g4f8bg9d72g74ad2642aea0" version="1">&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲&lt;/LSTag&gt;+[1]。</content>
	<content contentuid="h418db004g3b20g42bag905bg36942f33314a" version="1">九头蛇大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h27fd8ecegd284g4ef5g8437g4404de2c2f03" version="1">九头蛇印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hf27713f3g8b72g4af7g8a56g82c98dc42272" version="1">只要你保持&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="WET"&gt;湿润&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态，你的最大&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;增加[1]%。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6331b50bgf7aeg45d3g9332g617c03adf282" version="1">奇人大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h9ef9396eg745dg4909g97d5g1dcd49c5f820" version="1">奇人印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h8a58fd8fgcfc3g44b7gadd5gd56aa0d3b803" version="1">当受到敌方法术伤害时，你和施法者有[1]%的几率恢复所有的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。以攻击者的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;作为基准。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4fa47109g30d2g45abg8057g9ca3467901fe" version="1">疯狂大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h4fcd4821ga226g4796ga561g53ad58d8f960" version="1">疯狂印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h484ee2c3gc427g416cgac49g13020767e3ff" version="1">在对你造成近战武器伤害时，敌人有 [1]% 的几率获得「混乱」效果，持续 [2] 回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbcb3eb9ag96c5g4628ga2cdgec36d8a19100" version="1">闪电大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="ha8bc1fb9g576cg4991g8e8fg7adb7d9acceb" version="1">闪电印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hd3587a73g4b7fg45dbg8e95g4df7ba1b1c33" version="1">在用远程武器对你造成伤害时，敌人有 [1]% 的几率获得「侵略之闪」效果，持续 [2] 回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfccb98b5g39b0g4891g97c5g763904604c08" version="1">侵略之闪</content>
	<content contentuid="h44736ad6ga2e5g455bgb2d6g9170dd48d396" version="1">对使用远程武器进行的攻击掷骰有 -[1]~[2] 的修正。</content>
	<content contentuid="h94d3393fged10g48b1g824agfdbbfe9cf47f" version="1">至高救赎大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="ha8261c5cgd961g43bag8d36g1e99db49ee4e" version="1">乌龟大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h834b4f39g71bcg4f66g824cg72dbd1cf5adc" version="1">暗黑魔法大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hbf0c608cg203dg4da6g98adg40fe62cea36c" version="1">黑暗魔法印记</content>
	<content contentuid="ha9ad1218g4941g47d9g8702ge51feb4d9bac" version="1">人形生物对你进行的攻击掷骰点数，处于「劣势」效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc5b11092ga54eg4435gb486gd4d3fb8a3eab" version="1">猎人大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h1481cc15g0c9cg4108gac1bg872c32123609" version="1">猎人印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h58cde34bgb540g4d81g8c33g24a118360f43" version="1">野兽对你进行的攻击掷骰点数，处于「劣势」效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8bcd87f9gbf3eg4851gaef8g7654150cf542" version="1">北极熊大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h8e92aa32g5a9bg42c6gab75gd368e848a2ab" version="1">猛虎大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hb76b9a95g46c1g4112g86e2gf67999777f7e" version="1">探路者大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h1675b125gd1a6g434dgb81fg460d27c11fc6" version="1">探路者印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h30e1b412g78f7g4500gb850g9a379481db58" version="1">在成功闪避一次攻击时，有 [1]% 的几率获得「非凡感知」效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8b74b262g5c3cg4096gb09agd11b8967cb42" version="1">非凡感知</content>
	<content contentuid="hee3d74adg89f2g471cg9bd5ge1a9c5acdac3" version="1">每层此效果使你的「求生」和「感知」技能增加 +[1]。该效果没有持续时间，但每回合有 [2]% 的几率被驱散。</content>
	<content contentuid="h41029e3cg4671g4efbga962g3d040f2e9343" version="1">先人一步大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hc6c68cd2gad2dg4f29g9917g2b4b0aeb7864" version="1">先人一步印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h299f598agae1cg42a8ga10dg9a62a69dc454" version="1">在战斗外释放非法术施法时，你获得「先人一步」效果，持续 [1] 回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="h9e11dc53g2980g4059gaaf8gb8801243a285" version="1">先人一步</content>
	<content contentuid="h3a762030g5717g43d6g9174g2dd1f39a3008" version="1">你的先攻值增加 +[1]。</content>
	<content contentuid="hcca8816dg1e75g44b6g8c26gea2c26302ad1" version="1">活力之盾大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hc9f6736eg9f9dg4460g9cecg5a5a5425b864" version="1">活力之盾</content>
	<content contentuid="h2fa37fb0gaf2dg4fd0g89begf96fba9156ca" version="1">在战斗中每回合用法术治疗自己时，你获得「活力之盾」效果，持续 [1] 回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="h522cf0e9gc0beg4213gbec0g3377833ac135" version="1">活力之盾</content>
	<content contentuid="h1da9603cg1821g4be6g8ec5gb3e9df34f332" version="1">每层此效果使你所受到的伤害减少 [1] 点。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8c4440e1g6180g4964g90e2g58287209676c" version="1">大团圆大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="he98a22bag1daag46f4ga519g9831b89724f1" version="1">大团圆印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h75176f26gf1a3g44e0gb78cg943da6f3d5a2" version="1">在成功的抵抗敌人攻击或法术的豁免投骰后，你有 [1]% 的几率获得「高潮迭起」效果，持续 [2] 回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc939bff7g4de2g4fc4g8a29g5598b9776c97" version="1">高潮迭起</content>
	<content contentuid="h83a71d3bga100g4e43g8da4g9c74ebd28c95" version="1">如果豁免投骰结果小于等于 [1]，你可以重新投骰直到得到更高的点数，但最多不超过四次。重新投骰的阈值会随着等级而变化。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8550231cg887bg4216gacf6g26bd0c1e64ef" version="1">抗性拉满大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h76bca401gc32ag462cga0e9g1d76ea65287e" version="1">抗性拉满之印</content>
	<content contentuid="h87bdad23g0467g4ccfg9b32g0de42bd2e94e" version="1">你对任何伤害具有「抗性」。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdc7b69f2gecf6g489cg8439g1260885358ef" version="1">洞察大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h74d10f52g7e39g48a0g9bf3gc3d89db12a49" version="1">洞察之印记</content>
	<content contentuid="ha568b8a7g2c97g41d5g8c2fgf8a37db062a0" version="1">你对「致盲」具有「免疫」效果，并能驱散周围的恶意云雾。</content>
	<content contentuid="he22e9f9ag3ceeg486ag919dgf90253bf0b9e" version="1">巨魔之力大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h2e286520gfca4g48b5g8cc0g40301080f044" version="1">巨魔印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hfacc27eega8a5g40c8g9c4bg14a76d56872c" version="1">你的负重增加一倍，并且增加 [1] 点最大生命值。后者的效果会随着等级而变化。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha3a9fb44ga53cg4aa6g86b7g7619849d8694" version="1">暗影护盾大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h917b92a2g4e29g4468g9366g9eba6e4104ef" version="1">暗影护盾印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hbcde8422ge4deg4f44gb5daga1b1b007c7b9" version="1">你对死灵伤害具有「易伤」效果。当敌人对你施放法术时，你有 [1]% 的几率获得「暗影护盾」效果，持续直到你的回合开始。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc0e56b93gd010g4feeg9771gb9a52381f2bb" version="1">暗影护盾</content>
	<content contentuid="h605afd00g7844g47fbga6cbg16f59a769232" version="1">你会反弹由火焰、闪电、雷霆和力量造成的伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h684f2c68g2982g4738gacfbg0049cd5967ec" version="1">天罚之力大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h6e0c49fdg511bg4400g9231ge70a7a938ee1" version="1">天罚之力印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h15de6b75g9bb5g4ec8gab30gfb666398dc07" version="1">当敌人对你发动攻击并且生命值低于 [1]% 时，他们有 [2]% 的几率立即死亡。此效果每次只能在一次长休之后触发一次。</content>
	<content contentuid="hea7885dbgbd69g4945ga56cgd73d417e71a6" version="1">岩浆护盾大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h9708ea0cgc939g441dgb4d8gb11d736a31be" version="1">熔岩护盾印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hc6c2de49g6534g419agbf56g38a986baadb4" version="1">岩浆对你没有影响。当你进入岩浆时，你获得「岩浆护盾」效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8f8343bagb684g43e6g97a7gf23b5a01a5c9" version="1">岩浆护盾</content>
	<content contentuid="hc2f8cac2gb7dfg435cg8d7cgae3b997be1ea" version="1">你的护甲等级增加+[1]。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf166d380g07b8g4bdcg9408gd164f0847d47" version="1">吸血鬼领主大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hebd9cf0cgbba1g45d8g9f00g4c0e81fa2515" version="1">血雾</content>
	<content contentuid="hde496ff7g845cg4fc0g916cgea96de4c9bfe" version="1">当你移动时，你会留下一个血腥的云雾。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc316a829g74cdg4cfdg9c03g1f8bb2494adc" version="1">吸血鬼领主印记</content>
	<content contentuid="hcc2126eeg6ee7g42f0gbfc3g5562b496c029" version="1">对人形生物、地精或野兽造成重击时，有 [1]% 的几率恢复全部生命值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h773ae3d9g3581g4e19g9fc2gc12051875ff1" version="1">雇佣兵大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h2628a8b1gd88fg4ee7gb32cgce37e5d13eaa" version="1">风之力大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hb4c1163fg76a6g4d73gb82egcb1dfbb7ea1f" version="1">半神大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="hd7edb5c5g3ef8g40d3ga61bg59e0a493b017" version="1">半神之印</content>
	<content contentuid="h0ba464a2ge4e3g4cafgab0fgf51a14e4fd8f" version="1">低于 [1] 的攻击对你无效。</content>
	<content contentuid="h08ce46cagcfc4g44d9g9bf3gf16e4d17ca6f" version="1">奇迹大师斗篷</content>
	<content contentuid="h9cf32bf6g2da6g44dbgb4acg52667fdffeac" version="1">奇迹印记</content>
	<content contentuid="h53e536f4g2612g44c1gae75g89948d4dfdab" version="1">在进行能力或技能检定时，如果掷骰的骰子结果为 [1] 或更低，你可以自动重新掷骰直到获得更高的点数。</content>
